## Reproduce

```bash
tvbo validate study .                 # the tree and the filenames conform to the layout
tvbo run {study}.yaml                 # experiments in dependency order, then the figures
tvbo figure render {study}.yaml       # re-render figures only
cd docs && quarto render              # both report.pdf (public) and report_internal.pdf (local)
```

Inputs this study does not compute are listed in `sourcedata/README.md` with the steps to obtain them. They are not committed. The paper's own material lives in `original_study/`, which is git-ignored: no published figure or table reaches the public report.
